# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Client financial data & derived artifacts — NEVER COMMIT
# `*.xlsx` above covers source workbooks, but not the legacy .xls format nor
# anything derived from them (PDF/PNG/embeddings), which are equally sensitive.
# Directory-level rules so new artifacts are covered by default, not by luck.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.xls
*.pdf
financial-report-insights/data/
financial-report-insights/reports/
financial-report-insights/_superseded_docs/
